{"description": "The Burn Area Index (BAI) is generated from the Red and\nNear-IR bands, and measures the spectral distance of each pixel from a\nreference spectral point (the measured reflectance of charcoal).  This\nindex is intended to emphasize the charcoal signal in post-fire\nimages. See\n[Chuvieco et al. (2002)](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/01431160210153129)\nfor details. This product is generated from the MODIS/MYD09GA surface reflectance composites.\n", "extent": {"spatial": {"bbox": [[-180, -90, 180, 90]]}, "temporal": {"interval": [["2002-07-04T00:00:00Z", "2017-03-30T00:00:00Z"]]}}, "gee:categories": ["vegetation-indices"], "gee:interval": {"interval": 1, "type": "cadence", "unit": "day"}, "gee:is_derived": true, "gee:status": "deprecated", "gee:terms_of_use": "MODIS data and products acquired through the LP DAAC have no restrictions on subsequent use, sale, or redistribution.\n", "gee:type": "image_collection", "id": "MODIS/MYD09GA_BAI", "keywords": ["aqua", "bai", "daily", "global", "modis", "myd09ga", "surface-reflectance", "usgs", "vegetation-indices"], "license": "proprietary", "links": [{"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/MODIS/MODIS_MYD09GA_BAI.json", "rel": "self", "type": "application/json"}, {"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/MODIS/catalog.json", "rel": "parent", "type": "application/json"}, {"href": "https://storage.googleapis.com/earthengine-stac/catalog/catalog.json", "rel": "root", "type": "application/json"}, {"code": "JavaScript", "href": "https://code.earthengine.google.com/?scriptPath=Examples:Datasets/MODIS/MODIS_MYD09GA_BAI", "rel": "related", "title": "Run the example for MODIS/MYD09GA_BAI in the Earth Engine Code Editor", "type": "text/html"}, {"href": "https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/images/MODIS/MODIS_MYD09GA_BAI_sample.png", "rel": "preview", "type": "image/png"}, {"href": "https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/catalog/M